{"title":"Career Roadmap · Textile Merchandiser","role":"Textile Merchandiser","summary":"Career objective: Become a Textile Merchandiser who connects buyers, textile manufacturers, designers, production teams and suppliers, ensuring that textile/apparel orders meet requirements for product specifications, quality, costing, timelines and delivery.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Textile Technology","Product Knowledge","Costing","Sourcing","Quality","Communication","Supply Chain"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech Textile Engineering/Technology + textile fundamentals + merchandising"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Merchandising Executive / Junior Merchandiser"}],[{"text":"2033–2038"},{"text":"Merchandiser / Senior Merchandiser / Sourcing Specialist"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"Merchandising Manager / Product Development Manager"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Senior Merchandising Manager / Sourcing Head / Business Development Head"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during B.Tech/B.E.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering + textile foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Computer applications"},{"text":"Basic manufacturing"},{"text":"Communication skills"},{"text":"Introduction to textiles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the textile value chain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fibre","Yarn","Fabric","Dyeing/Printing","Finishing","Garment/Home Textile","Buyer","Retailer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Textile technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Fibre science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"t