"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Lead-time management"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Export documentation"},{"text":"Demand planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"PLM"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, internships should combine textile production + commercial exposure."},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Textile mills"},{"text":"Garment manufacturers"},{"text":"Export houses"},{"text":"Buying houses"},{"text":"Fashion brands"},{"text":"Home-textile manufacturers"},{"text":"Textile sourcing companies"},{"text":"Technical textile companies"},{"text":"Textile e-commerce companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merchandising Intern"},{"text":"Production Intern"},{"text":"Textile Quality Intern"},{"text":"Sourcing Intern"},{"text":"Product Development Intern"},{"text":"Textile Testing Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Intern"},{"text":"Export Documentation Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Try to understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Buyer","Product","Sample","Costing","Material","Production","Quality","Shipment"]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Textile merchandising"},{"text":"Apparel merchandising"},{"text":"Textile testing"},{"text":"Quality management"},{"text":"Supply-chain management"},{"text":"Export documentation"},{"text":"International trade"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"Product lifecycle management"},{"text":"Sustainable textiles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For academic textile and engineering courses, NPTEL can supplement university coursework.","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"}]},{"heading":"Careers you