":"p","text":"A good approach:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Confirm the delay","assess order impact","coordinate with sourcing/production","evaluate approved alternatives","communicate with the buyer","revise the production plan","monitor daily","protect quality and delivery commitments"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible postgraduate directions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Tech Textile Technology"},{"text":"M.Tech Textile Engineering"},{"text":"M.Tech Textile Processing"},{"text":"M.Tech Technical Textiles"},{"text":"M.Tech Textile Chemistry"},{"text":"MBA Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA International Business"},{"text":"MBA Fashion Management"},{"text":"M.Sc Fashion/Textile Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best choices by goal"},{"type":"note","label":"Technical textile career","text":"M.Tech Textile Technology / Technical Textiles"},{"type":"note","label":"Commercial leadership","text":"MBA Supply Chain / Operations / International Business"},{"type":"note","label":"Fashion business","text":"MBA Fashion Management"}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Italy"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fashion Management"},{"text":"Textile Technology"},{"text":"Textile Design & Technology"},{"text":"Fashion Business"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Luxury/Fashion Management"},{"text":"Sustainable Fashion"},{"text":"Technical Textiles"},{"text":"International Business"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technical graduate targeting international merchandising, combining textile engineering + supply chain/business can be particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"grow